# Shared development context belongs in Git: AGENTS.md, PROJECT.md, HARNESS/
# (including config.env and ACTIVE_CHANGE), specifications, plans/, decision
# records, templates, source, sanitized fixtures, go.mod and go.sum.
# Ignore generated output and machine-specific data, not governance filenames.

# Operating-system metadata
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Editors and local IDE state
.idea/
.vscode/
.fleet/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak

# Share reviewed project configuration, agent definitions, rules and skills.
# Account/session state is local; never copy a personal Codex home here.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.codex/*
!.codex/config.toml
!.codex/agents/
!.codex/rules/
!.codex/skills/
!.codex/environments/

# Build, package, test, and generated evidence
/bin/
/dist/
/artifacts/
